<h1>Modify Radius</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This command is accessible from the</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>t</b></span><span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>ree context menu</b></span> <span class="Path">for</span> <span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Datum Circle/Sphere &gt; Modify Radius</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
<p class="Description"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span class="Command">Modify Radius</span> <span lang="EN-GB">command increases/decreases radius of a datum sphere or circle.</span></p>
<table cellspacing="5" class="whs4">
<col>
<col>
<tr valign="top" class="whs5">
<td class="whs6">
<p class="whs7"><img src="Images/increase_radius2.jpg" width="257px" height="165px" border="0" class="img_whs8" alt=""></p>
</td>
<td class="whs9">
<p class="whs7"><img src="Images/increase_radius.jpg" width="257px" height="165px" border="0" class="img_whs8" alt=""></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Increase radius</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB">Amount of increasing/decreasing of the radius in millimetres. If the value is positive then the radius is increased, otherwise it is decreased.</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Create copy</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB">Check this option to generate new entity with the modified radius. If unchecked the entity to which the command is applied, is modified.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a2" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
